  "body": "Hidden From The World, Surrounded By Nature Yet Close to Everything\r\n\r\nFamily | Entertainment | Golf | Pool | Spa | Yoga | Gym \r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful and private setting, this St Heliers residence offers a rare sense of seclusion while remaining connected to everything that makes the Eastern Bays lifestyle so desirable.\r\n\r\nA sanctuary away from the everyday, the property presents an inviting opportunity to enjoy relaxed family living, effortless entertaining and the comfort of your own private retreat.\r\n\r\nWhether it’s quiet mornings surrounded by tranquillity, weekends spent with family and friends, or simply returning home to escape the pace of city life, this is a place where privacy and lifestyle come together.\r\n\r\nIt’s a rare combination of relaxation, recreation and natural beauty — where every corner of the estate offers something different to enjoy.\r\n\r\nSecurely positioned behind gates and set well back from the road, the property occupies an impressive 5,290m² freehold estate (more or less) overlooking the tranquil Dingle Dell Reserve. Surrounded by lush greenery and the soothing sounds of native birdsong, it feels a world away from the city, yet remains just moments from St Heliers Village, the waterfront, cafés and excellent schools.\r\n\r\nApproximately 317m² of floor area, this is a home designed for families who appreciate both togetherness and personal space.\r\n\r\nWith five covered garage spaces and extensive additional off-street parking, there is ample room for multiple vehicles, boats and recreational equipment.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking wellness, creativity or a dedicated recreational space, a separate light-filled cabin overlooking peaceful bushland offers remarkable versatility. Imagine your own private gym, yoga studio, gaming retreat, creative workspace or quiet sanctuary away from the main residence.\r\n\r\nA secluded swimming pool and spa area, complemented by a relaxing cabana, creates a private resort-like escape. Spend summer afternoons by the pool, unwind in the spa or entertain guests in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nFor golf enthusiasts, a dedicated putting green and sand bunker offer the opportunity to practise putting, chipping and bunker shots without ever leaving home.\r\n\r\nBeyond your peaceful surroundings, the vibrant St Heliers Village, beautiful beaches, waterfront cafés, local amenities and recreational spaces are all within convenient reach.",
